# State files contain secrets in plaintext (e.g. the Cognito client secret) -
# never commit these. Move to a remote (S3) backend before this matters for
# more than one machine - see backend.tf.example and docs/serverless-migration.md.
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
.terraform/
tfplan*
backend.hcl
*.tfvars
!*.tfvars.example
crash.log
crash.*.log
